{
    "title": "Smart Remote For Vizio TV",
    "description": "Remote Control app for Vizio Smart TV! Everything you need in your phone to take control of your experience with Smart Share.\r\n\r\nSmart Remote for Vizio TV is a mobile app that allows you to cast photos, videos, music, browser to your TVs and Soundbars through Vizio Smartcast.\r\nThe app works as a remote for all Smart TVs.\r\n\r\nScreen mirroring everything and enjoy endless entertainment at home now by your new favorite built-in apps: Smart Remote for Vizio TV. Casting hundreds of channels including news, sports, TV shows, and easily stream everything from your phone to all of your TV series.\r\n\r\n<b>How to connect</b>\r\nEasy setup,  connect your phone and TV to the same Wi-Fi network and you will be able to control your Smar TV.\r\n\r\n<b>Main Features</b>\r\n-        Fully functional remote control for Smart TV\r\n-        Screen Mirroring photos, videos with 4K Ultra HD\r\n-        Large touchpad\r\n-        Type with a keyboard\r\n-        Fast launch apps on your Smart TV\r\n-        Effortlessly share your favorite pictures, slide shows, presentations, and more\r\n-        Discovery everything you love all in one place\r\n-        Enjoy endless entertainment from your favorite apps including Netflix, Hulu, YouTube\r\n\r\n<b>Disclaimer:</b>\r\nSmart Remote for Vizio TV app is not affiliated with Vizio Inc or any other trademark mentioned here.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Remote Control app for Vizio Smart TV! Everything you need in your phone to take control of your experience with Smart Share.<br><br>Smart Remote for Vizio TV is a mobile app that allows you to cast photos, videos, music, browser to your TVs and Soundbars through Vizio Smartcast.<br>The app works as a remote for all Smart TVs.<br><br>Screen mirroring everything and enjoy endless entertainment at home now by your new favorite built-in apps: Smart Remote for Vizio TV. Casting hundreds of channels including news, sports, TV shows, and easily stream everything from your phone to all of your TV series.<br><br><b>How to connect</b><br>Easy setup,  connect your phone and TV to the same Wi-Fi network and you will be able to control your Smar TV.<br><br><b>Main Features</b><br>-        Fully functional remote control for Smart TV<br>-        Screen Mirroring photos, videos with 4K Ultra HD<br>-        Large touchpad<br>-        Type with a keyboard<br>-        Fast launch apps on your Smart TV<br>-        Effortlessly share your favorite pictures, slide shows, presentations, and more<br>-        Discovery everything you love all in one place<br>-        Enjoy endless entertainment from your favorite apps including Netflix, Hulu, YouTube<br><br><b>Disclaimer:</b><br>Smart Remote for Vizio TV app is not affiliated with Vizio Inc or any other trademark mentioned here.",
